16
00:00:40,416 --> 00:00:41,416
(knocking on door)

17
00:00:41,417 --> 00:00:43,087
(Howard:)Knock, knock.
Hi.
Hey.

18
00:00:43,085 --> 00:00:44,085
(Raj:)What brings you by?

19
00:00:44,086 --> 00:00:45,656
(Sheldon:)Oh...

20
00:00:45,655 --> 00:00:48,355
(Bernadette:)muffin much.

21
00:00:49,325 --> 00:00:51,425
(Howard:)Told you-- not funny.

22
00:00:51,427 --> 00:00:53,497
(Bernadette:)He's just not laughing

23
00:00:53,496 --> 00:00:59,026
(Bernadette:)because he's feeling...
blue berry.

